  "_images": "image is the frame this event leads with; images (when present) is the whole pool it may draw from, so a board showing several nights of one series can avoid repeating a photograph. A bio row flagged imageIsCard is a designed graphic rather than a photograph and is published with no image at all — the board then draws its own flat placeholder.",
